00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">one more time</font></font></font></b></font>

31
00:01:56,630 --> 00:02:00,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your destiny is to lose to me.
For sure.</font>

32
00:02:02,390 --> 00:02:05,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't know until you try!</font>

33
00:02:14,780 --> 00:02:18,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your father was killed a long time ago</font>

34
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I don't know the extent
of the pain you've felt...</font>

35
00:02:21,410 --> 00:02:27,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's a huge mistake for you to think
that has determined your entire destiny!</font>

36
00:02:28,710 --> 00:02:30,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're hopeless...</font>

37
00:02:48,730 --> 00:02:51,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Proctor... it's over.</font>

38
00:02:57,650 --> 00:02:59,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You failure...</font>

39
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:10,620
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Dropout's Hidden Power!</font>

40
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:17,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't... run away.</font>

41
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:24,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't... run...</font>

42
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:29,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll... stand by my own words...</font>

43
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:32,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my Ninja Way!</font>

44
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:39,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll...</font>

45
00:03:41,820 --> 00:03:43,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">stand...</font>

46
00:03:45,830 --> 00:03:47,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by my own...</font>

47
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:50,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">words!</font>

48
00:03:51,290 --> 00:03:54,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my... Ninja Way...</font>

49
00:03:56,790 --> 00:03:58,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think I've heard that line before...</font>

50
00:03:59,210 --> 00:04:02,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You with your destiny stuff...</font>

51
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:04,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose...</font>

52
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:07,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to a jerk with cold feet like you,
no matter what!</font>

53
00:04:09,850 --> 00:04:10,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

54
00:04:15,610 --> 00:04:20,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A brat who knows nothing
shouldn't lecture arrogantly!</font>

55
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:26,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">People are born burdened with
an inherent destiny that they cannot defy.</font>

56
00:04:32,410 --> 00:04:35,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji... live...</font>

57
00:04:35,630 --> 00:04:37,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a man who is blessed
with Hyuga ability</font>

58
00:04:37,790 --> 00:04:40,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">more than anyone in the family...</font>

59
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:47,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted you... to be born
into the head family...</font>

60
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:55,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't possibly understand</font>

61
00:04:55,440 --> 00:04:59,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the destiny of being burdened with
a mark that cannot be wiped off for life!</font>

62
00:05:42,020 --> 00:05:43,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

63
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:45,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I do understand it.</font>

64
00:05:48,700 --> 00:05:52,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... what of it?</font>

65
00:05:53,080 --> 00:05:54,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This brat!</font>

66
00:05:57,540 --> 00:05:59,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be acting cool...</font>

67
00:06:00,790 --> 00:06:04,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not just you who's special!</font>

68
00:06:07,970 --> 00:06:14,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata was also...
suffering the same as you!</font>

69
00:06:15,100 --> 00:06:18,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though she's the head family,
not being acknowledged as such...</font>

70
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:19,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">trying desperately to change herself...</font>

71
00:06:21,940 --> 00:06:26,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She fought you while coughing
up blood with that in mind!</font>

72
00:06:27,900 --> 00:06:29,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You too!</font>

73
00:06:30,530 --> 00:06:32,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The branch family that
protects the head family...</font>

74
00:06:32,580 --> 00:06:34,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Doing all that to Hinata
just because it's an exam.</font>

75
00:06:35,910 --> 00:06:38,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In actuality, you were just as frantic</font>

76
00:06:38,710 --> 00:06:40,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in attempting to go
against destiny, right?</font>

77
00:06:54,850 --> 00:06:57,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Vitality has returned to Hinata's face!</font>

78
00:06:58,730 --> 00:07:00,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just what I'd expect of
the ANBU Black Ops...</font>

79
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She'll be okay.</font>

80
00:07:03,730 --> 00:07:05,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now she needs bed rest.</font>

81
00:07:20,750 --> 00:07:23,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your 64 Chakra Points are now shut...</font>

82
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:28,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How are you, who can't use Chakra
for awhile, planning to fight?</font>

83
00:07:32,590 --> 00:07:33,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At the end of the day,</font>

84
00:07:33,930 --> 00:07:36,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you and Hinata-sama have
the same destiny!</font>

85
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:38,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

86
00:07:39,100 --> 00:07:43,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With your Byakugan, labeling people
and talking like you understand!</font>

87
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:50,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then... show me whether what
you're saying is true or not.</font>

88
00:07:52,910 --> 00:07:56,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will! I'll defeat you no matter
what and prove that to you!</font>

89
00:07:58,790 --> 00:08:01,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it... Damn it!</font>

90
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:05,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That being said, I don't feel Chakra at all.</font>

91
00:08:05,710 --> 00:08:09,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It feels like when I used up
my Chakra in the training.</font>

92
00:08:14,510 --> 00:08:17,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You possess two kinds of Chakra...</font>

93
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:21,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You must extract and utilize, at any time,</font>

94
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:25,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the other huge Chakra that
has rested inside you from the start...</font>

95
00:08:27,190 --> 00:08:30,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it. The Nine-Tailed Fox Chakra...
I'll use that...</font>

96
00:08:43,710 --> 00:08:47,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stinking fox...
Help me out!</font>

97
00:08:53,300 --> 00:08:55,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is as far as the talking goes.</font>

98
00:08:55,930 --> 00:09:00,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Proctor... I'm going to fight with
the intent to kill him!</font>

99
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:02,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're going to stop me,
please feel free.</font>

100
00:09:04,980 --> 00:09:05,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez.</font>

101
00:09:12,070 --> 00:09:13,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Didn't I tell you it is pointless?</font>

102
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:21,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time, I really can't lose!</font>

103
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:25,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll win no matter what!</font>

104
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:29,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's futile... I pressed the Chakra Points...</font>

105
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:33,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter what...</font>

106
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:38,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, yeah! Be sure to come
watch me kick that Neji's butt!</font>

107
00:09:44,730 --> 00:09:47,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A failure beats down
a genius with effort...</font>

108
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:50,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His opponent might be me...</font>

109
00:09:51,690 --> 00:09:55,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But even if that's you, Naruto-kun,
no hard feelings.</font>

110
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:09,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you try to go against
your destiny that much?</font>

111
00:10:17,220 --> 00:10:18,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I was called...</font>

112
00:10:20,010 --> 00:10:21,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a failure!</font>

113
00:10:38,740 --> 00:10:42,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, no way! Chakra is seeping out.</font>

114
00:10:42,870 --> 00:10:44,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the meaning of this...?</font>

115
00:10:59,630 --> 00:11:02,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-He...!
What in the world...?!</font>

116
00:11:15,070 --> 00:11:16,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What is he...?!</font>

117
00:11:17,780 --> 00:11:19,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be... This Chakra!</font>

118
00:11:20,990 --> 00:11:23,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-That's... impossible!</font>

119
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:30,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way! His Chakra Points
have been pressed!</font>

120
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:44,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Chakra...
It's the Nine-Tailed Fox's, no doubt...</font>

121
00:11:44,850 --> 00:11:47,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When did he master
the Nine-Tailed Fox's Chakra...?!</font>

122
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:07,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go!</font>

123
00:12:32,100 --> 00:12:33,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's twisting...</font>

124
00:12:37,270 --> 00:12:40,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that?!
Is that even Chakra?!</font>

125
00:13:00,250 --> 00:13:04,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Awesome power.
More so than during the training...</font>

126
00:13:08,430 --> 00:13:09,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I feel it!</font>

127
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:28,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rotation!</font>

128
00:13:41,550 --> 00:13:42,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

129
00:13:43,800 --> 00:13:47,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His speed's gone up!
What in the world is going on?!</font>

130
00:14:14,830 --> 00:14:15,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

131
00:14:18,250 --> 00:14:20,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're confident in close combat, right?!</font>

132
00:14:24,710 --> 00:14:26,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're going to become the Hokage...?</font>

133
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:29,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't... think so.</font>

134
00:14:31,430 --> 00:14:35,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only a very small percentage of
Shinobi are chosen to be the Hokage!</font>

135
00:14:36,520 --> 00:14:37,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look more at reality!</font>

136
00:14:38,940 --> 00:14:42,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who become the Hokage
are born with destiny.</font>

137
00:14:43,860 --> 00:14:45,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not something you become
by trying to become it.</font>

138
00:14:46,780 --> 00:14:49,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's determined by destiny.</font>

139
00:14:49,610 --> 00:14:51,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">People must live within
their different respective currents</font>

140
00:14:51,950 --> 00:14:54,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that can't be gone against.</font>

141
00:14:59,420 --> 00:15:02,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know what the
